<section class="problem wrap" aria-label="The problem">
  <div class="statement"><p>Git clients were built for people who write code. <span class="soft">Now your agents write it, faster than you can follow.</span> Your job went from <span class="strike">writing code</span> to <span class="hl">deciding what ships,</span> <span class="soft">but when your tools can't keep up, you stop reading and start trusting your agents.</span> {PRODUCT_NAME} is the Git client for the agentic era. <span class="soft">See what happened, where you're needed, and what's still in progress.</span></p></div>
